<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="f8ea0b4">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop train-the-trainer material which should include supplementary information such as interesting facts,
        illustrative anecdotes, areas to highlight, and trainee questions to expect.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Review, refine and amend train-the-trainer material. Repeat as required.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
